# vhs tape (https://github.com/charmbracelet/vhs) - run from repo root: vhs docs/demo.tape
# Offline fixture, no keys. docs/demo.gif was made with asciinema+agg from the same command.
Output docs/demo.gif
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1000
Set Height 700
Set TypingSpeed 40ms
Type "python examples/mcp_client_demo.py"
Enter
Sleep 8s
